<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia to mount Cambodia evacuation - radio.</title>
<headline>Australia to mount Cambodia evacuation - radio.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia will on Friday start to evacuate up to 600 Australians, plus Canadians, New Zealanders and Swedes, from strife-torn Cambodia, Australian radio said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Australia will send two planes to Cambodia tomorrow to help up to 600 Australians who want to leave the country. They will also be used to take Canadians, New Zealanders and any Swedish nationals out of Cambodia,&quot; the Australian Broadcasting Corporation said.</p>
</text>
